Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:04.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clothing photos look simple to classify.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:09.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,But does a model that scores well on clean test images survive when the picture is shifted?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:13.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,FashionShift is a workbench for testing exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:18.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,It trains three models on Fashion-MNIST, then audits them on a test set they never saw during training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:22.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,On the live bench, every image comes from the untouched official test set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:27.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,The top line is the dataset truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:31.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Below it are a logistic regression, a small convolutional network, and the same network trained with augmentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:35.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,Raise the abstain threshold and low-confidence calls go gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:40.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,All of this runs in your browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:45.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,The evidence tab keeps it honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:50.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,On the untouched 10,000-image test set, the plain network scores 91%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:55.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,The augmented network trades a little clean accuracy, landing at 88.5%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:01:01.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the weak classes are the same in every model: shirts, pullovers, and tees blur together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:05.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,The stress lab is where the models break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:10.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Blur, occlude, or shift the images and watch the calls change live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.83,0:01:15.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,A four-pixel shift collapses logistic regression to 41%, and drops the plain network to 58%.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:19.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,The augmented network holds 80%.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:24.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,But under blur and occlusion, augmentation does not help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:29.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,The uncomfortable part: confidence stays high while accuracy falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,Even on shifted images, wrong calls average 60 to 75% confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:39.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,So abstaining on confidence alone will not catch shifted inputs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:43.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can import your own image or a spreadsheet batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:47.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The pipeline shows exactly what the model sees. Sessions stay in your browser, and the model card exports with one click.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:51.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,Honest numbers, honest limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.76,0:01:55.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,That is FashionShift.